<%- include("partials/head", {
  title: "Bulk Beef — Halves & Wholes | Tui Farms, Manheim PA",
  description: "Buy beef by the half or whole from Tui Farms in Manheim, Lancaster County PA — our best price per pound, cut to your own cut sheet, frozen and boxed at the farm. Text 717-803-1649 to reserve."
}) %>
<%- include("partials/nav") %>
<%- include("partials/page-title", {
  heading: "🧊 Bulk Beef — Halves & Wholes",
  subheading: "Fill the freezer once at our best price per pound"
}) %>

<section class="page-section" style="max-width:860px;">

  <!-- Intro -->
  <p style="text-align:center; max-width:38em; margin:0 auto 1.5em;">
    Filling a freezer once beats shopping for beef every week — and buying by
    the half or whole is the best per-pound price we offer, on every single cut.
  </p>

  <!-- The value bomb -->
  <div class="bulk-callout">
    Every pound costs the same — the filet mignon that runs
    <strong>$38/lb</strong> by the package costs the same
    <strong>$11.25/lb</strong> in a whole.
  </div>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <h2 style="color:var(--primary); text-align:center; margin:1.6em 0 0.8em;">How it works</h2>
  <ol class="bulk-steps">
    <li>
      <h3>Reserve</h3>
      <p>
        Text <strong>717-803-1649</strong> and tell us half or whole. We'll give
        you the timeline and sort out the details by text — including anything
        you'd pay upfront.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <a class="btn" href="<%= reserveHref %>">Text to reserve</a>
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Your cut sheet</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        You decide what your animal becomes: steak thickness, roast sizes, how
        much ground. Never done one? It takes about 10 minutes and we'll walk
        you through every choice.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>We handle the rest</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        Butchering, vacuum packing, and freezing — all through our local butcher.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Pick up your beef</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        Everything comes frozen, labeled, and boxed, ready to pick up at the
        farm in Manheim.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <!-- Pricing recap -->
  <div class="card" style="margin:2em 0;">
    <h3 style="color:var(--primary); margin-top:0;">What it costs</h3>
    <table class="pricing-table">
      <tr>
        <td>Whole beef — about 450 lbs of cuts</td>
        <td>$11.25/lb packaged</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Half beef — about 225 lbs of cuts</td>
        <td>$12.00/lb packaged</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      The final total goes by actual packaged weight — every animal is a little
      different.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Freezer guide -->
  <div class="card" style="margin:2em 0;">
    <h3 style="color:var(--primary); margin-top:0;">Will it fit?</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>A half beef</strong> takes about 7 cubic feet — a small chest
      freezer swallows it with room to spare.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <strong>A whole beef</strong> takes about 13 cubic feet — a standard
      full-size chest freezer handles it comfortably.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- What you get -->
  <div class="card" style="margin:2em 0;">
    <h3 style="color:var(--primary); margin-top:0;">What you get</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
      Roughly half comes back as ground and everyday beef, and the rest as
      steaks and roasts — and your cut sheet shifts that balance whichever way
      your family eats.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%- include("partials/order-info") %>
</section>

<style>
  /* ---- bulk page (only this page uses these) ---- */
  .bulk-callout {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.1em 1.3em;
    font-size: 1.12em;
    max-width: 34em;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .bulk-steps {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bulk-steps li {
    counter-increment: step;
    position: relative;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.1em 1.3em 1.1em 4em;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  .bulk-steps li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    left: 1.1em;
    top: 1.1em;
    width: 1.9em;
    height: 1.9em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .bulk-steps h3 { color: var(--primary); margin: 0 0 0.3em; }
</style>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
